{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261109/photo/bkn-20261109202804153-1109_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261109202804\"/><p>疑犯與警員駁火後倒在地上。</p><p>波蘭南部城市克拉科夫上周六（7日）發生槍擊案，造成至少6死15傷。槍手與警員激烈交火後中彈被制服，延至周一（9日）凌晨不治。初步調查顯示，槍手是一名極端民族主義者，受極右翼意識形態強烈影響。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T12:43:18.454472+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T12:28:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:37:18.221973+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T12:37:18.221973+00:00","content_hash":"19fff302e94bbcc667072b3c956763cd2b1dd21328a7a8abd99e1e0ffac8e26c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}